From 13217b5620718f3a4ac2bc34d31b0999b1c4ca09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Basanagouda Nagappa Koppad <basanagouda.nagappa.koppad@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:06:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] android: Adapt upstream Android.bp for Celadon A17

Upstream libdrm ships its own Android.bp since 2.4.124 (21ac1816a
"Convert to Android.bp"), so the Intel conversion of the Android.mk
files carried since 2.4.115 ("Changes to compile libdrm in Android") is
no longer needed. Only three adjustments remain:

- Rename the generated_static_table_fourcc_h genrule to
  libdrm_intel_generated_static_table_fourcc_h. AOSP external/libdrm
  stays in the tree (its libdrm_sys bindings are used by the drm-ffi
  crate) and defines a genrule with the same name.
- min_sdk_version "35" on libdrm for A17 and the com.android.virt apex.
- -D_GNU_SOURCE, as meson's config.h does, so that the glibc host
  variants see mmap64() and asprintf().

The KW fix for intel_bufmgr_gem.c is dropped: no binary in the image
links libdrm_intel. The xe_drm.h copy is dropped as well: libva now
takes the kernel UAPI header from bionic.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1589
Signed-off-by: Basanagouda Nagappa Koppad <basanagouda.nagappa.koppad@intel.com>
Change-Id: I5290fa079d85d1465be2171d1fbc004107d92b6e
---
 Android.bp | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 4a2bd9852..829d9aa65 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ cc_defaults {
     name: "libdrm_defaults",
     cflags: [
         // XXX: Consider moving these to config.h analogous to autoconf.
+        "-D_GNU_SOURCE",
         "-DMAJOR_IN_SYSMACROS=1",
         "-DHAVE_VISIBILITY=1",
         "-DHAVE_LIBDRM_ATOMIC_PRIMITIVES=1",
@@ -60,7 +61,7 @@ cc_library_headers {
 }
 
 genrule {
-    name: "generated_static_table_fourcc_h",
+    name: "libdrm_intel_generated_static_table_fourcc_h",
     out: ["generated_static_table_fourcc.h"],
     srcs: ["include/drm/drm_fourcc.h"],
     tool_files: ["gen_table_fourcc.py"],
@@ -79,7 +80,7 @@ cc_library {
     ],
 
     generated_headers: [
-        "generated_static_table_fourcc_h",
+        "libdrm_intel_generated_static_table_fourcc_h",
     ],
 
     export_include_dirs: ["include/drm", "android"],
@@ -94,4 +95,5 @@ cc_library {
         "//apex_available:platform",
         "com.android.virt",
     ],
+    min_sdk_version: "35",
 }
-- 
2.34.1

